{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56323","headline":"送郑[郢]（逞）州 · 林铎","name":"送郑[郢]（逞）州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官从书府拜，吏向武闾迎。\n（见《吟窗杂录》卷二九《历代吟谱》。\n）（按：郁贤皓先生《唐刺史考》卷一九三载郑姓任郢州刺史者，贞元十年有郑某，十六年有郑正则。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林铎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56323.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56323","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}